    <section class="paper-section">
        <div class="shell max-w-3xl py-3 text-center">
            <img class="mx-auto h-38 w-auto"
                 src="/assets/img/logo_2.png"
                 alt="Lewandoski's Market">
            <p class="mt-6 text-xl font-bold">100 Years of Polish, Right Here on the West Side</p>
            <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl leading-8">
                Our market has been a fixture on Grand Rapids' West Side since 1923. Come in for high-quality products, incomparable recipes, and food made for the people we call neighbors.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="feature-split bg-market-cream">
        <div class="feature-image order-last sm:order-first">
            <lqip-image>
            <img class="lqip__placeholder"
                 src="/assets/img/c40d684b2c5b44d6b968115ed95ee4aa-32.webp"
                 alt=""
                 aria-hidden="true"
                 role="presentation">
            <picture>
                <source type="image/avif"
                        srcset="/assets/img/c40d684b2c5b44d6b968115ed95ee4aa-480.avif 480w,
                                /assets/img/c40d684b2c5b44d6b968115ed95ee4aa-768.avif 768w,
                                /assets/img/c40d684b2c5b44d6b968115ed95ee4aa-1024.avif 1024w,
                                /assets/img/c40d684b2c5b44d6b968115ed95ee4aa-1440.avif 1440w">
                <source type="image/webp"
                        srcset="/assets/img/c40d684b2c5b44d6b968115ed95ee4aa-480.webp 480w,
                                /assets/img/c40d684b2c5b44d6b968115ed95ee4aa-768.webp 768w,
                                /assets/img/c40d684b2c5b44d6b968115ed95ee4aa-1024.webp 1024w,
                                /assets/img/c40d684b2c5b44d6b968115ed95ee4aa-1440.webp 1440w">
                <img class="lqip__image"
                     src="/assets/img/c40d684b2c5b44d6b968115ed95ee4aa.jpeg"
                     sizes="(min-width: 640px) 50vw,
                            100vw"
                     alt="Hot food to go"
                     loading="lazy"
                     decoding="async">
            </picture>
            </lqip-image>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-copy">
            <h2 class="section-title">Hot food to go</h2>
            <p class="mt-4 section-subtitle">Wednesdays & Fridays</p>
            <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-8">
                Every Wednesday and Friday, 11 AM to 2 PM. Find weekly menu information on Facebook or call (616) 454-2281.
            </p>
            <a class="button mt-7"
               href="https://www.facebook.com/162729067084313"
               target="_blank"
               rel="noreferrer">Weekly Menu</a>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="paper-section">
        <div class="shell max-w-5xl text-center">
            <h2 class="section-title">Explore the Market</h2>
            <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8">
                Discover Polish grocery staples, fresh cuts, homemade favorites, and market gifts at Lewandoski's Market.
            </p>
            <nav class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3"
                 aria-label="Product categories">
                <a class="button" href="/products/sausage">Fresh Kielbasa &amp; Sausage</a><a class="button" href="/products/meats">Fresh Meats</a><a class="button" href="/products/homemade-foods">Homemade Foods</a><a class="button" href="/products/polish-grocery">Polish Grocery</a><a class="button" href="/products/gift-cards-and-gifts">Gifts &amp; Gift Cards</a><a class="button" href="/products/breads-and-desserts">Breads &amp; Desserts</a>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="paper-section">
        <div class="shell max-w-4xl">
            <h2 class="section-title text-center">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
            <div class="mt-10">
                <details class="market-details">
                    <summary>Do you make fresh kielbasa and sausage?</summary>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Yes. Lewandoski's Market offers fresh and smoked kielbasa, Krakowska, and a selection of house-made sausage. Visit the market to see today's selection.
                    </p>
                </details>
                <details class="market-details">
                    <summary>Where is Lewandoski's Market located?</summary>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">You can find us at 1107 Walker Ave NW in Grand Rapids, Michigan, on the West Side.</p>
                </details>
                <details class="market-details">
                    <summary>What are your market hours?</summary>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">We are open Monday through Saturday from 9 AM to 5:30 PM. We are closed on Sundays.</p>
                </details>
                <details class="market-details">
                    <summary>Do you carry Polish grocery products?</summary>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Yes. Our market carries Polish grocery staples, pierogi, specialty ingredients, and familiar pantry favorites.
                    </p>
                </details>
                <details class="market-details">
                    <summary>How do donation requests work?</summary>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        We support nonprofit and community-related causes when possible. Submit donation requests at least four weeks before your event through our donation request form.
                    </p>
                </details>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="paper-section">
        <div class="shell">
            <h2 class="section-title text-center">Gallery</h2>
            <div class="gallery-grid mt-10">
                {% for item in gallery %}
                    <a class="gallery-item group{% if item.wide %} gallery-item--wide{% endif %}"
                       href="{{ item.image }}">
                        {% assign base = item.image | remove: ".jpeg" %}
                        <lqip-image>
                        <img class="lqip__placeholder"
                             src="{{ base }}-32.webp"
                             alt=""
                             aria-hidden="true"
                             role="presentation">
                        <picture>
                            {% if item.maxWidth == 480 %}
                                <source type="image/avif"
                                        srcset="{{ base }}-320.avif 320w,
                                                {{ base }}-480.avif 480w">
                                <source type="image/webp"
                                        srcset="{{ base }}-320.webp 320w,
                                                {{ base }}-480.webp 480w">
                                <img class="lqip__image"
                                     src="{{ item.image }}"
                                     srcset="{{ base }}-320.webp 320w,
                                             {{ base }}-480.webp 480w"
                                     sizes="(min-width: 768px) 20vw,
                                            50vw"
                                     alt="{{ item.title }}"
                                     loading="lazy"
                                     decoding="async">
                            {% else %}
                                <source type="image/avif"
                                        srcset="{{ base }}-320.avif 320w,
                                                {{ base }}-480.avif 480w,
                                                {{ base }}-640.avif 640w,
                                                {{ base }}-768.avif 768w,
                                                {{ base }}-1024.avif 1024w">
                                <source type="image/webp"
                                        srcset="{{ base }}-320.webp 320w,
                                                {{ base }}-480.webp 480w,
                                                {{ base }}-640.webp 640w,
                                                {{ base }}-768.webp 768w,
                                                {{ base }}-1024.webp 1024w">
                                <img class="lqip__image"
                                     src="{{ item.image }}"
                                     srcset="{{ base }}-320.webp 320w,
                                             {{ base }}-480.webp 480w,
                                             {{ base }}-640.webp 640w,
                                             {{ base }}-768.webp 768w,
                                             {{ base }}-1024.webp 1024w"
                                     sizes="(min-width: 768px) {% if item.wide %}40vw{% else %}20vw{% endif %}, {% if item.wide %}100vw{% else %}50vw{% endif %}"
                                     alt="{{ item.title }}"
                                     loading="lazy"
                                     decoding="async">
                            {% endif %}
                        </picture>
                        </lqip-image>
                        <span>{{ item.title }}</span></a>
                {% endfor %}
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
